  "description": "按实际配置形成能力模板，按本次任意机器人池生成实例简历。引用需展开且部署需验证后才能发布。",
  "sources": {
    "manipulator_limits": {
      "path": "/home/pupil/下载/manipulator_capabilities(1).json",
      "schema_id": "eai.manipulator_capability",
